    "title": "Tidbyt",
    "description": "To use this app you'll need a working Internet connection, Bluetooth, and a Tidbyt device.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTidbyt is a smart display for your desk or shelf. It shows you the time, weather, your calendar, and more. Put your Tidbyt on your desk and stay updated just by glancing over. No need to even take your phone out of your pocket.\r\n\r\nWith this app, you can:\r\n\r\n- Setup your Tidbyt device and get it connected to the Internet.\r\n- Adjust your Tidbyt's brightness and other settings.\r\n- Choose what to show on your Tidbyt. Pick from our growing collection of screens like weather, train times, stocks, and more.",
